# Generated province rasters (~106 MB). Rebuild output, not source: they ship
# as an asset of the rolling `province-rasters` GitHub release and are restored
# with `npm run province:fetch`. The set is defined in
# tooling/province-artefact/set.json; the committed manifest is
# apps/world-studio/public/province/rasters-manifest.json.
apps/world-studio/public/province/chunks/**/*.png
apps/world-studio/public/province/refined/*.png
apps/world-studio/public/province/water/**/*.png
apps/world-studio/public/province/vegetation/**
